    "confidence": "medium",
    "notes": "Verichains and Zokyo report approximately $6.8 million lost across the coherent Velocore campaign on Linea and zkSync. The selected Linea transaction drains seven pools and directly records, among the multi-asset proceeds, 632,705.032352 USDC transferred from the Velocore Vault to the attack contract. The reported cross-chain total is retained without pretending that this one stablecoin component represents the campaign loss."
