    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T19:23:18Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the successful Linea receipt and full call trace, all seven defect-executing ConstantProductPool creation traces, deployment-block and pre-exploit runtimes, the commit-pinned reproduction, Verichains' technical analysis, and Zokyo's post-mortem. Attack contract 0xb7f6354b2cfd3018b3261fbc63248a56a24ae91a directly calls velocore__execute(address,bytes32[],int128[],bytes) three times on each of seven pools before Vault 0x1d0188c4b276a09366d05d6be06af61a73bc7535 calls the same entrypoint to realize the corrupted accounting. No pool call delegates execution. Each 17,153-byte direct runtime is absent in the block before its internal CREATE by factory 0xbe6c6a389b82306e88d74d1692b67285a9db9a47 and has the same hash at deployment and immediately before the exploit: e2c67a block 128549:1 hash 0x5acd76d2160393ea6b82f9eb1fd09fcf02b9b040a5b55da5ec17f2c5499bbeb0; 820aaf block 178197:4 hash 0x4c8174df0ce940be28a46decc2e39eaae439a90543b07afce3b17eaa5ca03a14; 1d12e2 block 1089428:6 hash 0xe37842fa2ba5bc7732a13361edd10ca4192647a967c5658ed765e7e62169fa86; d0e67c block 166346:9 hash 0x23208b3707ef8ed43ae741ae1d7e4ebcef16bb0aee5381af5411b2a0eaa18601; f3e3ec block 273362:1 hash 0x0ee292a13576b0de201f0c3e1c4a2b51416ca23c16a34d0b314c9e43e11bf370; 99ee72 block 1089610:4 hash 0x5b686ee74a0fb45513bb194ad47c8bbb852b893fc1f877a3e3d0a985249c0bed; bd4b27 block 874867:11 hash 0x73a62e729ccf2c5483f52c21a33847b677c87acba736dcd72859abbcd8d87fd4. The receipt records 632,705.032352 USDC transferred from the Vault to the attack contract alongside other assets. Verichains and Zokyo report an approximately $6.8 million campaign loss across Linea and zkSync."
    },
